{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-010",
    "title": "下山旧路"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_057",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "她把一张折好的路引递给他。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "卯时，山雾尚未散尽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1354,
          "end": 1354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临带着沈砚秋给的铜钥匙，来到外门档房。档房在演武坪后方，门窗都用厚木封了半边，只留一道窄缝透气。门上没有匾额，只有一枚褪色的朱印，印文被磨去一角。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1356,
          "end": 1356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他敲了三下门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1358,
          "end": 1358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "里面传来拖椅子的声音。一个头发花白的老者探出脸来，先看钥匙，再看陆照临的木牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1360,
          "end": 1360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈执事让你来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1362,
          "end": 1362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1364,
          "end": 1364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三架，最底层，只看写着西坡的卷宗。看完放回原处。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1366,
          "end": 1366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果卷宗少了呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者看了他一眼：“那就当它从来没有在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1370,
          "end": 1370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房内弥漫着霉味与干燥墨香。三排木架从地面一直顶到屋梁，卷宗按年份和院落分列。陆照临找到第三架，最底层只有七卷，封皮上的“西坡”二字大多被水浸过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1372,
          "end": 1372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一卷记载旧阵维修，第二卷记载药圃移栽，第三卷是夜巡轮值。翻到第四卷时，他看见一张补录纸，日期正是三年前冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1374,
          "end": 1374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1376,
          "end": 1376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人陆沉舟，奉命送灯至西坡旧井。同行三人，名录另附。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1378,
          "end": 1378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名录处却是一片空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1380,
          "end": 1380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把纸举到窗缝的光里。纸纤维没有被撕过，空白像是原本就没有写字。然而纸张边缘残留着极浅的灰白印痕，和废井石片上的纹路相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1382,
          "end": 1382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他继续往后翻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1384,
          "end": 1384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯未归，旧井封闭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1386,
          "end": 1386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "下一页被整齐裁掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1388,
          "end": 1388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住裁口，发现纸背粘着一小块薄薄的铜箔。铜箔上刻着半个名字：叶——。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1390,
          "end": 1390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外忽然响起脚步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1392,
          "end": 1392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者在架外咳了一声：“别动其他卷。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1394,
          "end": 1394
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把铜箔夹进袖中，回头看去。沈砚秋站在门口，身旁还跟着顾长离。顾长离的脸色比平日更冷，手里握着一封没有封口的信。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1396,
          "end": 1396
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你找到什么？”沈砚秋问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1398,
          "end": 1398
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟确实来过西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1400,
          "end": 1400
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这点我没有否认。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1402,
          "end": 1402
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“同行三人是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1404,
          "end": 1404
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名录被裁掉了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1406,
          "end": 1406
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1408,
          "end": 1408
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧档整理时出错。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1410,
          "end": 1410
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前的卷宗，为什么现在还在整理？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1412,
          "end": 1412
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有回答。她走到木架前，手指掠过封皮，最后停在第四卷的裁口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1414,
          "end": 1414
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲不是玄霄宗弟子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1416,
          "end": 1416
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“七日足够有人把镇上的记录烧干净。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1442,
          "end": 1442
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把信从她手里抽走：“你家族的账，不要牵连玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1444,
          "end": 1444
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它已经牵连了。”顾长离说，“账上有玄霄宗的印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1446,
          "end": 1446
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房里一阵沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1448,
          "end": 1448
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把第四卷放回架上，袖中的铜箔贴着皮肤，传来微弱的热意。那半个名字到底是叶观澜，还是另一个姓叶的人？他没有证据，不能把猜测当成答案。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1450,
          "end": 1450
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋走到他面前，压低声音：“今晚之前，把你从西坡带走的所有东西交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1452,
          "end": 1452
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括残印？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1454,
          "end": 1454
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的眼神第一次出现明显的震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1456,
          "end": 1456
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你碰过它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1458,
          "end": 1458
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只确认它在我掌心留下了痕迹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1460,
          "end": 1460
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋伸手想抓他的手腕，陆照临却后退一步。顾长离同时上前半步，铜针在袖中发出轻响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1462,
          "end": 1462
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者咳得更重：“档房内不得动手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1464,
          "end": 1464
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋收回手：“残印不是力量，是债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1466,
          "end": 1466
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁的债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1468,
          "end": 1468
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有还记得它的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1470,
          "end": 1470
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她说完便转身离开。顾长离没有立刻跟上，而是从袖中取出一张薄纸，塞进陆照临手里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1472,
          "end": 1472
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上画着一条旧驿道，第一站的灯被人用墨涂黑。旁边写着一行小字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1474,
          "end": 1474
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无灯镇只在夜里无灯，白日仍有守门人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1476,
          "end": 1476
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要下山？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1478,
          "end": 1478
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是现在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1480,
          "end": 1480
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1482,
          "end": 1482
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“给你一个选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1484,
          "end": 1484
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次替这个名字作出判断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他为什么失踪？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1608,
          "end": 1608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为他送的不是灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1610,
          "end": 1610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1612,
          "end": 1612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬头看向三盏长明灯：“一段不能被点亮的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1614,
          "end": 1614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有再解释。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1616,
          "end": 1616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走出登记堂时，顾长离正在台阶下等候。她背着一个旧布包，腰间铜针比平时多了两枚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1618,
          "end": 1618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也要下山？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1620,
          "end": 1620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要去无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1622,
          "end": 1622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为顾氏账本？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1624,
          "end": 1624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三年前离开的三名账房中，有一个是我叔父。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1626,
          "end": 1626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折好的路引递给他。路引上盖着顾氏旁支的印，日期正是冬至前七日。印章缺口与废井铜环完全一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1628,
          "end": 1628
        }
      }
    ],
